{
  "variant": "news",
  "data": "PUBLIC RECORDS standing in for PAGASA's and MDRRMD's: GSMaP (JAXA) and ERA5 (Open-Meteo) weather, news reports of signals, fires (Asia Fire News), and floods (MMDA lists in the news). Real, but incomplete; see ml/README.md",
